---
import BaseHead from '../../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import FooterScripts from '../../../components/FooterScripts.astro';
import SrkrHeader from '../../../components/SrkrHeader.astro';
import SrkrFooter from '../../../components/SrkrFooter.astro';
import OffCanvas from '../../../components/OffCanvas.astro';
import DeptNav from '../../../components/DeptNav.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title="Department of Computer Science & Design | SRKR Engineering College" description="Department of Computer Science & Design at SRKR Engineering College, Bhimavaram â€” established 2021, where computer science meets creativity, design, and immersive technology." />
  </head>
  <body>
    <SrkrHeader />

    <!-- BREADCRUMB -->
    <section class="rts-breadcrumb breadcrumb-height breadcumb-bg" style="background-image: url(/assets/images/banner/breadcrumb.jpg);">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-12">
            <div class="breadcrumb-content">
              <ul class="breadcrumb">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/departments">Departments</a></li>
              </ul>
              <h1 class="section-title">Department of Computer Science & Design</h1>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <!-- BREADCRUMB AREA END -->

    <!-- content -->
    <div class="rts-faculty-details py-5">
      <div class="container">

        <DeptNav dept="csd" current="Home" />

        <!-- About the Department -->
        <div class="row align-items-center justify-content-md-center mb-5 pb-5">
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11">
            <div class="faculty-content-text me-5">
              <h3 class="rts-section-title mb-5">About the Department</h3>
              <p>The Department of Computer Science and Design combines computational rigor with user-centered design, creativity, and interactive digital product development.</p>
              <p>Students are trained to integrate programming, design thinking, interface aesthetics, and usability principles to build meaningful technology experiences.</p>
              <p>The program promotes hands-on creation through studio practice, prototyping, interdisciplinary projects, and innovation activities that connect technology with human needs.</p>
              <p>By blending technical depth with creative problem-solving, the department prepares graduates for emerging roles in product engineering, UX technology, immersive media, and digital innovation.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11">
            <div class="ratio ratio-16x9 mt-5 mt-lg-0">
              <iframe
                src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/zWHp1cRW8fc?html5=1&enablejsapi=1"
                title="SRKR Department Video"
                loading="lazy"
                allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share"
                referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin"
                allowfullscreen
              ></iframe>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Message from HoD -->
        <div class="row mt--30">
          <div class="rts-section mb--60">
            <h3 class="rts-section-title">Message from Program Coordinator</h3>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
          <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-8">
            <div class="faculty-image text-center">
              {/* TODO: Replace with actual HoD photo at /assets/images/faculty/csd/PLACEHOLDER.jpg */}
              <img class="img-fluid mw-100" src="/assets/images/faculty/csd/PLACEHOLDER.jpg" alt="Dr. M. Sumalatha">
              <div class="h5 mb-2 mt-5">Dr. M. Sumalatha</div>
              <span>Associate Professor &amp; Program Coordinator</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-lg-8">
            <div class="faculty-content-text ms-lg-5 mt-5 mt-lg-0">
              <p class="h6 mb-4">Welcome to the Department of Computer Science &amp; Design</p>
              <p class="mb-5">The Department of Computer Science &amp; Design (CSD) at SRKR Engineering College was established in 2021 to nurture a new generation of engineers who can blend rigorous computer science with creative design thinking. With an annual intake of 60 students, our B.Tech CSD programme prepares graduates for careers at the intersection of software, interaction, immersive media, and product innovation.</p>
              <p class="h6 mb-4">Where Computer Science Meets Creativity</p>
              <p class="mb-5">Aligned with NEP 2020, our project-based curriculum combines core CS foundations â€” programming, data structures, databases, web technologies â€” with design-led courses in UX/UI, game development, animation, AR/VR, computer graphics, and creative coding. Students engage with industry-standard tools (Figma, Unity, Unreal Engine, Blender, Adobe Creative Suite) and build real products, games, and interactive experiences from their first semester.</p>
              <p class="h6 mb-4">Innovation, Startups &amp; Industry Readiness</p>
              <p>CSD operates under the umbrella of the SRKR Technology Centre, with access to the AICTE IDEA Lab, Innovation Centre, on-campus startups, and a 400+ system computing facility. Students are mentored to launch their own ventures, intern from semester one, and graduate as designers, developers, founders, and creative technologists. I warmly invite you to explore our programme and join a community that builds the future of digital experience.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="border-top my-60"></div>

          <!-- Mission & Vision -->
          <div class="row align-items-center justify-content-md-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11 rts-scholarship-description">
              <div class="faculty-content-text si__list me-5">

                <h4 class="font-32 mb-3 mt-4">Vision</h4>
                <ul class="list-unstyled one-column-list mb-0">
                  <li class="mb-3">To be a leading centre for Computer Science &amp; Design education that produces creative technologists shaping the future of digital products, experiences, and immersive media.</li>
                  <li>To foster innovation, entrepreneurship, and human-centred design thinking among engineering graduates.</li>
                </ul>

                <h4 class="font-32 mb-4">Mission</h4>
                <ul class="list-unstyled one-column-list">
                  <li class="mb-3">To deliver a project-based curriculum that integrates computer science fundamentals with design, UX, game development, animation, and AR/VR.</li>
                  <li class="mb-3">To cultivate creativity, critical thinking, and problem-solving through hands-on studios, internships, and industry collaboration.</li>
                  <li class="mb-3">To empower students to build startups, ship products, and contribute meaningfully to the creative-tech ecosystem.</li>
                </ul>

              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-11">
              <figure class="mt-5 mt-lg-0">
                {/* TODO: Replace with departmental hero image */}
